<section class="section section-projects" id="projects">
  <div class="sec-head" data-reveal>
    <p class="kicker">SELECTED WORK — 2024 → 2026</p>
    <h2>Selected<br /><span class="fill-violet">Work</span></h2>
    <p class="sec-sub">A mix of full-stack apps, hackathon builds and experiments — each one designed, built and shipped end to end.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="pin-layout">
    <aside class="pin-left" data-reveal>
      <p class="kicker">FEATURED PROJECTS</p>
      <div class="pin-index"><span id="pinCurrent">01</span><small> / 06</small></div>
      <div class="pin-bar"><div id="pinProgress"></div></div>
      <p>Two deep-dives plus four builds from hackathons and the lab. Scroll to walk through each one — stack, story and outcome.</p>
      <div class="pin-blob" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    </aside>

    <div class="project-list">
      <article class="project-card featured" data-reveal data-project-index="0">
        <div class="pj-top"><span class="pnum">01 — FEATURED</span><span class="pyear">2025 // WEB</span></div>
        <h3>Personal Developer Portfolio Website</h3>
        <p class="pj-desc">Fully responsive React single-page app showcasing projects, skills &amp; background. Dark/light theme toggle, SEO best practices, GitHub Pages + Actions CI/CD, reusable component architecture, mobile-first layout.</p>
        <div class="tags"><span>React.js</span><span>CSS3</span><span>GitHub Pages</span><span>Actions</span><span>SEO</span></div>
        <div class="pj-foot">
          <a href="https://github.com/HarshKumar30/Portfolio" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View Code ↗</a>
          <span class="pnote">Outcome — Lighthouse 100</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="project-card" data-reveal data-project-index="1">
        <div class="pj-top"><span class="pnum">02</span><span class="pyear">2025 // FULL-STACK</span></div>
        <h3>Task Tracker Application</h3>
        <p class="pj-desc">Full-stack task manager — Python/Flask backend + dynamic JS frontend. Normalized SQLite schema (priority, due date, status, category), optimized filter/sort queries, RESTful JSON API, drag-and-drop reorder, deadline highlighting, persistent state.</p>
        <div class="tags"><span>Python</span><span>Flask</span><span>SQLite</span><span>JavaScript</span><span>REST API</span></div>
        <div class="pj-foot">
          <a href="https://github.com/HarshKumar30" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View Code ↗</a>
          <span class="pnote">Outcome — Full CRUD + API</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <div class="project-grid">
        <article class="project-card mini" data-reveal data-project-index="2">
          <div class="pj-top"><span class="pnum">03</span><span class="pyear">HACKATHON // IOT</span></div>
          <h3>LPG Leakage Detection</h3>
          <p>Arduino / ESP32 sensor rig with real-time alerts. Designed and demoed in 24 hours.</p>
          <div class="tags"><span>IoT</span><span>Arduino</span><span>ESP32</span></div>
        </article>
        <article class="project-card mini" data-reveal data-project-index="3">
          <div class="pj-top"><span class="pnum">04</span><span class="pyear">HACKATHON // SECURITY</span></div>
          <h3>Doc Security Suite</h3>
          <p>Steganography + cryptographic signing for tamper-proof documents.</p>
          <div class="tags"><span>Python</span><span>Crypto</span><span>Stegano</span></div>
        </article>
        <article class="project-card mini" data-reveal data-project-index="4">
          <div class="pj-top"><span class="pnum">05</span><span class="pyear">HACKATHON // A11Y</span></div>
          <h3>Eye-Tracking Keyboard</h3>
          <p>Assistive keyboard powered by WebGazer.js gaze prediction in-browser.</p>
          <div class="tags"><span>JS</span><span>WebGazer.js</span><span>A11y</span></div>
        </article>
        <article class="project-card mini" data-reveal data-project-index="5">
          <div class="pj-top"><span class="pnum">06</span><span class="pyear">LAB // ML</span></div>
          <h3>Financial Time-Series Prediction</h3>
          <p>LSTM &amp; Transformer architectures for market forecasting. Final-year project.</p>
          <div class="tags"><span>Python</span><span>LSTM</span><span>Transformer</span></div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script src="../scripts/github.ts"></script>
